sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Player
  participant M as Meta (server)
  participant D as ProfileStore
  participant R as Run (server)
  P->>M: joins
  M->>D: load the profile, session-locked
  D-->>M: save (gear, bank, XP, Gloom per layer, classes, codex)
  M-->>P: player attributes: level, coins, Gloom
  P->>R: dive
  R->>R: run-only currencies (RunCoins, MineLevel) stay out of the save
  R->>M: bank the haul at a Lift station
  M->>D: write into the profile (autosaved)
  Note over R,M: a wipe keeps gear, loses what was not banked
  P->>M: forge mini-game strikes
  M->>M: the server times every strike
  P->>M: leaves
  M->>D: save and release the lock
